  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICORN - International Cities of Refugee Network 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to International City of Refugees Network, whic offers shelter to writers and artists at risk, advancing freedom of expression, defending democratic values and promoting international solidarity. ICORN provides protection services that are relevant for women writers and artists.</narrative>
  </description>
